description: "Roguelike runs on the Serpulo campaign, in a separate campaign so yours is not touched. Relics, curses and modifiers. Roguelike Campaign: no belts or pipes, every building trades with the core, faster and bigger waves. Vanilla Campaign: the normal game with the roguelike rewards."
